From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: premohq <48417750+premohq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: folders and files anyone can write, whatever the umask

0028 made Azahar's folders with mkdir(0777), the app's umask being 0 then. The app no longer sets one
(on the PS5 umask is a raw system call in the app's own code), so the console's took the others' write
bits away: the 3DS's folders came out 0755 and its files 0644. A folder or save a root session made
(the HEN's jailbreak) shut out a later session as the app's own user, which then could not make a
game's save folder or write its shader cache, and the game stopped on a fatal error (#90: Permission
denied under /data/azahar). The folder's mode is now set again after mkdir, and a file opened for
writing is made 0666 where the process may change it.
---
 src/common/file_util.cpp | 22 +++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/common/file_util.cpp b/src/common/file_util.cpp
index efe7a48..d586179 100644
--- a/src/common/file_util.cpp
+++ b/src/common/file_util.cpp
@@ -329,16 +329,21 @@ bool CreateDir(const std::string& path) {
 
 #else
 #ifdef __PROSPERO__
-    // Anyone's to write, as the port's own folders are (its umask is 0): the app runs as root with
-    // the HEN's jailbreak and as its own user without, and the console's FTP service as another,
-    // and a folder one of them made 0755 kept the others out: a game's saves and shader cache
-    // (#55), installed titles no file manager could delete (#58)
+    // Anyone's to write: the app runs as root with the HEN's jailbreak and as its own user without,
+    // and the console's FTP service as another, and a folder one of them made 0755 kept the others
+    // out: a game's saves and shader cache (#55, #90), installed titles no file manager could delete
+    // (#58). The app keeps the console's umask (it cannot set its own: port/main_ps5.cpp), which takes
+    // mkdir's write bits for the others away, so the mode is set again after
     constexpr mode_t mode = 0777;
 #else
     constexpr mode_t mode = 0755;
 #endif
-    if (mkdir(path.c_str(), mode) == 0)
+    if (mkdir(path.c_str(), mode) == 0) {
+#ifdef __PROSPERO__
+        chmod(path.c_str(), mode);
+#endif
         return true;
+    }
 
     int err = errno;
 
@@ -1404,6 +1409,13 @@ bool IOFile::Open() {
 #else
     m_file = FOPEN(filename.c_str(), openmode.c_str());
     m_good = m_file != nullptr;
+#ifdef __PROSPERO__
+    // PS5: a file written here is anyone's to write too, as CreateDir's folders (the umask made it
+    // 0644): a save a root session wrote, a session as the app's own user could not (#90). Only the
+    // file's owner, or root, may change it; else it stays as it is
+    if (m_good && openmode.find_first_of("wa+") != std::string::npos)
+        fchmod(fileno(m_file), 0666);
+#endif
 #endif
 
     return m_good;
